WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-New York governor Andrew Cuom
recently allowed weddings

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:07.374
in the state to resume with up
to 150 guests, as long as --

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.309 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Wow! Weddings, huh?

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:11.077 line:92%
You've got to be kidding me.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:11.644 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, I'm sorry.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is one of my writers,
Dina Gusovsky.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dina, are you not
on board with this plan?

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.719 size:88% position:44%
Are you worried it might
lead to a COVID spike?

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.755 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, yeah. Sure.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:22.956 line:92%
-Frustrated with Governor Cuom

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
and his handling
of the pandemic?

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.126 line:92%
-Oh, I am very frustrated.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the worst time
to have a wedding.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:30.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I mean, I think
we can all agree with that

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How am I supposed to
have a wedding

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.634 line:92%
when I don't even have a groom

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.069 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, boy.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:39.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, I thought I had years
to get married.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:40.273 line:92%
You're telling me I need to find

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
a single Jewish guy
to marry now?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the real
public-health crisis.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:47.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dina, I don't think this mean
you have to get married.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know, I'm sure
there are plenty of

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.317 size:75% position:38% line:92%
nice guys who would.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:51.885 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Please, Seth.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:55.288
Do you have any idea how har
it is to date during a pandemic?

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:58.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I haven't been touched
since I heard Amanda Gorma

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:01.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
read that poem at
the inauguration.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.328 line:92%
-Dina, I know it must be hard,

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
but people are still datin
during COVID, right?

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, great.
Another COVID-safe date.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.836 size:75% position:38%
If I wanted to be in
a relationship where

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:13.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
we had to sit 6 feet apart
I'd get married in Connecticut

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Look, Dina, I don't want
to criticize you,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
but is it possible
your standards are too high?

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:23.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Didn't realize you and
my mother had been chatting.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
But maybe I should
widen my search.

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I guess not
every gentleman

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.757 line:92%
can be the Second Gentleman.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.324 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Really, Dina?

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're still pining over
Doug Emhoff?

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:37.163 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Still? Even more now.

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.032 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at him.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:39.432 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, man.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:43.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
That guy really gets my
Jewish space lasers beaming.

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:46.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seth, I can't help it
if he sets my forest on fire

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:51.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
One glance at him,
and I got to clear some brush.

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:54.314 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh...

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, Dina, I'm sorry to say
but, as you know,

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:59.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
as we've discussed here
on the show multiple times

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:03.490
Doug Emhoff is already married
to Vice President Kamala Harris.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:07.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, trust me -- I know he
mixes with the shiksas.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
But with a body like
Doug Emhoff's,

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm willing to look
the other way.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here's the thing
I can't get past.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.903
I understand that Doug Emhof
has a lot of the qualities

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:19.239
you're looking for in a husband,
but the fact you find him

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be such a physical specimen
I just don't see it.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I guess you
better tell my dreams,

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they did not
get the memo.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.316
I don't want to get too graphic,
but every morning,

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:35.555
I have to wring out my sheet
like a dishrag over the bathtub.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.090 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Dina!

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:40.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was almost
incomprehensibly graphic.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:43.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Seth,
I'm playing to the crew.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:44.597 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I know what they like.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.633 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:52.238
Look, if Cuomo wants to allo
150-person weddings in New York,

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.406 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I guess that's fine.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:54.340 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Oh, yeah? Why's that?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.709 size:88% position:44%
-Well, if these weddings
lead to another spike,

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:59.646
maybe I'll meet a nice
Jewish doctor in the ICU.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
Dina Gusovsky, everybody.

